**Implementation cannot safely start from this specification.** The wrong behaviours it would let through are:
- **Gold discount:** the feature and test expect 8400 where the AC says 8500, so a 16% discount would be built and pass.
- **Rounding:** AC-4 has no scenario, so any rounding rule passes. The author's "full coverage" claim is false.

I could not run the test because there is no production code, so it fails to compile instead of failing on an assertion. I only read the files and did not build anything.

I did not edit any artefact. I wrote the verdict to `.copilot-tracking/skraft-plans/pricing/reviews/2026-10-18/distill-review-1.md`.
